            "image_avata": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/ludmila-ditetova2.jpg",
            "heading": "",
            "content": "<p>Ahinsa shoes allow the foot natural movement because they provide plenty of space for the toes. The thin and flexible outsole lets the foot perceive the ground. We must mention the ethical and ecological production in the Czech Republic. An ideal choice for anyone who wants more from their shoes and wants to enjoy a real walk.<br\/><\/p>",
            "title": "Mgr. Ludmila Dítětová",
            "pos": "physiotherapist",
            "rating": 5
          }
        },
        "quote_QQex6D": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "image_avata": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/hana-borecka.jpg",
            "heading": "",
            "content": "<p>Ahinsa shoes are beautiful, original Czech barefoot shoes, with careful craftsmanship and high-quality materials — natural or recycled. They provide generous space in the front of the foot, which is necessary for correct toe posture and influences the posture of the whole body.<br\/><\/p>",
            "title": "MUDr. Hana Bořecká",
            "pos": "doctor",
            "rating": 5
          }
        }
